abstract: >-
  Supporting safer, more inclusive parks for women and
  girls.


  A free mapping tool that brings together open data and
  spatial insights to help practitioners understand the
  factors that shape safety and inclusion in parks across
  England and Wales.


  Use the dashboard to:


  Visualise park safety factors

  Explore spatial data layers

  Make decisions with evidence

  Create safer parks in your area
